        'The ending is stark, and meant to be. But forgiving isn’t pretending it didn’t hurt, or letting someone keep hurting you. It’s choosing, often again and again, to let go of the right to get even, and to leave justice with God. It can take time. You can start by praying for the will to forgive.'
